== fixed-format styles (en_US)
ISO8601 default   : 2026-11-21T07:05:00Z
ISO8601 date only : 2026-11-21
ISO8601 week date : 2026-W47-06
Verbatim y-MM-dd  : 2026-11-21
Interval          : Nov 21 – 25, 2026
Interval de_DE    : 21.–25. November 2026
HTTP              : Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:05:00 GMT
Anchored named +1d: tomorrow | days only: in 1 day
Anchored named +2d: in 2 days | days only: in 2 days
Anchored named +6d: in 6 days | days only: in 6 days
Anchored named +7d: next week | days only: in 7 days
Anchored named +13d: in 2 weeks | days only: in 13 days
Anchored named +40d: next month | days only: in 40 days
Template j:mm via DateFormatter de_DE: HH:mm
Template yMMMd ja_JP: y年M月d日
